  "place": "dungeon kiln_forge set A (The Old Kilns, Kiln Ridge, level 17-20): the end boss in the Master Kiln",
  "_doc": "The Slagborn firecaller who fires the great kiln at the top of the ridge, and fires people in it when the bricks run short. P1 \"Firing\": fire bolts, a flame cone, and the four kiln mouths round the room venting in turn. Two bellows levers: pump one and the draught pulls the fire off the floor (removes the burning ground). P2 at 60% \"Sealed Kiln\": he steps into the master kiln and seals the door — close the three dampers (use them) to choke the fire and crack the seal. P3 new bar \"Firing Heat\": the heat climbs — a ring around him, a fire on each player that spreads, and a heat surge that only the kiln mouths' shadow (stand next to a mouth) escapes. OWNER #51 (2026-10-15): the phase that refilled the health bar is removed; the health bar is the whole fight.",
  "party": "Solo: hard. 2-3: one on dampers and bellows. 5: as designed.",
